    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d212">

                <pb facs="0388" n="348" xml:id="pg348"/>

                <head>Mr. Adams to Mr. Hunter</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 949.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">London,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 11, 1865</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> In reference to the subject-matter of the
                    despatch from the department No. 1314, of the 21st of March, I have the honor to
                    transmit copies of a note of mine to Lord Russell, of the 4th of April, and of
                    his reply, dated the 8th instant.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES FRANCIS ADAMS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">William Hunter,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary of State, Washington, DC.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d212-a1.xml" xpointer="d212-a1"/>
